## The PDF Gold Standard

The directory `C:\Users\augus\OneDrive\Desktop\Typikon digest\` contains human-authored PDF digests that represent the correct output format. These are the **authoritative reference** for what the generator should produce.

**Before marking any resolver or section as "complete", you MUST:**
1. Generate the digest for the SAME date as one of the PDF examples.
2. Extract the PDF text (using `fitz`/PyMuPDF).
3. Do a line-by-line comparison.
4. Report every discrepancy.

